{"title":"Desktop app","description":"Stirling PDF for Windows, macOS and Linux - downloads, connection modes and where to go next.","unlisted":false,"space":"desktop","layout":"","article":"\n    <h1>Desktop app</h1>\n<p>The desktop app runs the Stirling PDF editor and most tools on your own computer, with no account needed. For tools that can't run locally, sign in to Stirling Cloud or connect to your organisation's server (<a href=\"/Desktop/Connection-Modes/\">Connection modes</a>).</p>\n<p>On a <a href=\"/Desktop/Managed-Deployment/\">managed installation</a>, your administrator can require sign-in, restrict account choices, or keep all document processing on the device.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>System</th>\n<th>Download</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows 10 or 11 (x64)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/win-installer.exe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MSI installer</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Windows on ARM</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-PDF/releases/latest/download/Stirling-PDF-windows-arm64-setup.exe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Setup .exe</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS 10.15 or later (Apple silicon and Intel)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/mac-installer.dmg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DMG</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux (x86_64)</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.deb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DEB</a> · <a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.rpm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RPM</a> · <a href=\"https://files.stirlingpdf.com/linux-installer.AppImage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AppImage</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"cards cards-3\"><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Install/\">Install</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Installers, package managers and first launch.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22v-5M9 8V2M15 8V2M18 8v5a6 6 0 0 1-12 0V8z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Connection-Modes/\">Connection modes</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Sign in to Stirling Cloud or connect to a server.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Where-Tools-Run/\">Where your tools run</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>When a file stays on your computer and when it doesn't.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Files/\">Opening and saving files</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Default PDF app, saving and windows.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Updates-and-Data/\">Updates, data and uninstall</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Update settings, data folders and logs.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 21v-7M4 10V3M12 21v-9M12 8V3M20 21v-5M20 12V3M1 14h6M9 8h6M17 16h6\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Desktop/Managed-Deployment/\">Managed deployment</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>Require sign-in, restrict account choices, keep documents local, and pre-configure many machines.</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"card card-link\"><span class=\"card-icon\"><svg class=\"icon\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3H6a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v16a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-9\"/><path d=\"M13 3v6h6\"/><path d=\"m17.5 11.5 3 3-4.5 4.5H13v-3z\"/></svg></span><div class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/Tools/\">User guide</a></div><div class=\"card-body\"><p>How to use every tool.</p>\n</div></div></div>\n\n    <div class=\"doc-source\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/Stirling-Tools/Stirling-Tools.github.io/edit/main/docs/Desktop/Desktop.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M17 3a2.83 2.83 0 1 1 4 4L7.5 20.5 2 22l1.5-5.5L17 3z\"/></svg>\n        Edit this page on GitHub\n      </a>\n    </div>","toc":"","pager":"<span></span><a class=\"pager-link pager-next\" href=\"/Desktop/Install/\">\n        <span class=\"pager-dir\">Next &rarr;</span>\n        <span class=\"pager-title\">Install</span>\n      </a>"}